      <p class="mu">Looking for an intern or a collaborator on a security, data or full-stack project? Send me a message.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="font-semibold hover:text-[var(--a)]" href="mailto:aayushyadav2051@gmail.com">aayushyadav2051@gmail.com</a><button id="copy" class="pill copy">Copy email</button></div>
